# Row I0.6: an opening's money. Only the recruiter, the opening's hiring manager and the admin read it; everyone else in the
# tenant is answered not-found (404). Wen holds no part in this opening's hiring; the tenant gate answers 403 to a person with
# no grant, no session and a candidate's guest cookie.
GET /api/interviews/openings/{openings.backend}/spend | interviewer=404 interviewer2=404 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter hiringManager
GET /api/interviews/openings/{openings.ios}/spend | interviewer=404 interviewer2=404 hiringManager=404 workOnly=403 anon=403 guest=403 | recruiter
